### Example

This is an example of building c++ libs once, and use them in different c++=
 projects.

```sh
cocos new -l cpp -p my.pack.app1 test_app1
mkdir app1_build && cd app1_build
cmake ../test_app1 -DGEN_COCOS_PREBUILT=3DON
make prebuilt
```

Change option `GEN_COCOS_PREBUILT` and use instead `USE_COCOS_PREBUILT` to =
use prebuilt in the same project

```sh
