make TemplateCpp
open bin/TemplateCpp.app
```

Add `-DUSE_COCOS_PREBUILT=3DON` to use prebuilt libs in another cmake build=
.

```sh
cocos new -l cpp -p my.pack.app2 test_app2
mkdir app2_build && cd app2_build
cmake ../test_app2 -DUSE_COCOS_PREBUILT=3DON
make TemplateCpp
open bin/TemplateCpp.app
```

